  "_note": "Rigify LEGACY face rig (generated prior to the Rigify face rewrite — uses master_eye.L/R / eyes / tongue_master / lips.L+lips.R for mouth corners; no eye_master / eye_common / jaw_master_mouth / lip_end / tweak_tongue / forehead / temple / ear.*.001). Companion to the overhauled flat face BVH (66 face bones, all flat-parented to Head, zero-constraint, PascalCase names from extract_face_calibration.py's rename map). Body / fingers / legs identical to rigify_human_new_face.json. Same masters-only design rationale as the NEW preset: source records every face bone's head-local delta independently; replaying every bone on a target whose internal cascade already produces motion from masters double-counts. Pair list verified against OLDRIGIFYrig_analysis.json constraint dump. OLD rig's jaw cascade is a nuanced gradient (MCH-jaw_master.000-.004 inherit jaw_master at 100%/75%/35%/10%/3% respectively) rather than the NEW rig's binary mix — lip.T cascades only 10% with jaw (acceptable mild over-extension), lip.B cascades 100% (same trap as NEW, DROPPED). Mouth corners are 'lips.L' / 'lips.R' on OLD (35% jaw cascade — same role as NEW's lip_end.L/R.001). Lid .002 widgets are parented directly to master_eye.L/R with COPY_LOCATION→MCH-eye.L.001 inf=0.50 (eye-track follow) plus the cheek link at 0.10 on the lower lids — usable masters. Brow B endpoints (brow.B.L / brow.B.L.004) parent to master_eye.L; we don't drive master_eye so endpoints are effectively independent. Cheek upper auto-follows cheek lower at 0.50 (same pattern as NEW — drop explicit upper-cheek pairs). DROPPED face pairs: JawTip/Chin/Chin1/LeftChinPad/RightChinPad/LeftJawCorner1/RightJawCorner1 (parent jaw_master, 100% jaw cascade); Tongue/Tongue1/Tongue2 (tongue_master parents to jaw_master, 100% jaw cascade); LowerLip → lip.B (parent MCH-jaw_master = 100% jaw cascade, would over-extend on any jaw motion); LeftUpperLip/RightUpperLip/LeftLowerLip/RightLowerLip (target lip.T/B.L/R.001 cascade from lip.T+lips.L at 0.50 each); LeftBrow1-3 and RightBrow1-3 (brow ridge middles cascade from .002 endpoint and brow.T.*.002 muscle middle); LeftBrowMuscle2/RightBrowMuscle2 (brow.T.*.002 interpolates between .001 and .003); LeftCheekUpper/RightCheekUpper (cheek.T.L/R.001 already auto-follow cheek.B.L/R.001 at 0.50 OFFSET — driving both double-counts); Nose1/Nose3/Nose4 (MCH-nose cascade from nose.002); LeftNostril1/RightNostril1 (cascade from nose_master + lip); LeftForehead* / RightForehead* / LeftTemple / RightTemple (NOT IN OLD RIG — no forehead or temple controls exist); LeftEar / RightEar (source has no ear bones — no pairs needed). Total face pairs: 28 (vs NEW's 39 — difference is the absent forehead/temple set). face_capture_compensation off, all regions at 1.0 (no character-tuned defaults baked in).",
